{"version":1,"content":"<p>巴西一起涉及高端顯卡的大規模失竊案件近日出現新進展。此前，一家巴西硬件分銷商披露，兩託盤從美國進口的Zotac GeForce RTX 5090顯卡在聖保羅瓜魯柳斯國際機場離奇失蹤，貨物總價值約47萬美元。如今，當局表示已有三名機場工作人員被認定與案件有關，同時其中一塊失竊顯卡還曾出現在網上公開出售。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583582.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:40.463106+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:40:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.629476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.629476+00:00","content_hash":"1b1ff9be39bd45a383e6211646936fe41fcc243aba9a8cdcf65e1cce5a895111","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}